msgctxt "64"
msgid "Hey, cut it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Huh? Whaddaya want, old man? You got somethin' to say to us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "Please, help me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"What do you think you're doing here? Stop wasting your time and start making"
" meaningful contributions to society."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Oh, but we are! Have you smelled this guy? Reeks to the top of the "
"Millennium Tower!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Guys like him are worse than garbage... And takin' out the trash will "
"contribute way more to society than this guy ever would! Hehehe!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Taking out the trash, huh? All right."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"So you get where we're coming from, huh? Then why don't you piss off, old "
"man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Well, hold on just a second. I think I want to help out society by taking "
"out the trash, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Huh? What're you yammerin' about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Getting rid of garbage human beings like you will be a great benefit to the "
"city, don't you think? Why don't I give you a few pointers on the right way "
"to take out trash?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "Now you're askin' for it, old man! Get 'im!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Now entering battle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2440"
msgid "Kiryu"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2444"
msgid "Punk"
msgstr "Teppista"

